      "hash": "a27078bfc6b5fd60b2c2ea51e3db5de7f1f14bf68278506ea5f18e4af3301a43"
    },
    {
      "id": "06fe142d00fbde094705277a09181d494142df1a74d34181f6b2e27da5aa092c",
      "text": "AI Engineer Roadmap",
      "hash": "29a768799acab15b5a0ee28f241b6e057d0b5ff706c70c3edf7f24676f3d77a8"
    },
    {
      "id": "a9319a89116ff9c75cad3d3eabff90d711ebc5272e4f89044b2a03cab65e33a0",
      "text": "AI Coding Dictionary",
      "hash": "4def77f9388809f53620144510fcc4b6f08662617bcc06a15abc618242e6544c"
    },
    {
      "id": "1d6d9944ed907c37111e0b098a427d7e15c9b0db087260f963165118741c5cea",
      "text": "Topics",
      "hash": "e22820fcf5cd90e3fdd99a7569e0ee2f30eb7ebadfb2fe4d159b30c166ff81b7"
    },
    {
      "id": "ca04696a0d103c72eeb659328b66c6f91663bd90cf68599f09591ad7b9d6d722",
      "text": "The Model",
      "hash": "1954409637324f1c3f2cab102211fd161a6cd1c270252fc2e1297a69ab9a446b"
    },
    {
      "id": "726c742c94f5a2807c503cfb024c6bf6d8af6866561d38c8187b7e1f19ab9f95",
      "text": "Token",
      "hash": "d2089be672953d1136faa84079af1b6f3967fed8932dabffba3032d30e3c0618"
    },
    {
      "id": "748f97953f33f1ed2f5a738e5cdabea57b841bdb1c6bb87ca11011eb2ed034da",
      "text": "The atomic unit a model reads and writes. Roughly word-sized but not exactly. Context window size, cost, and latency all count tokens.",
      "hash": "31bce3c71e1acd9ea3fc77b80a3a9ad805591a2b7af267f6e002849ad08d7fc3"
    },
    {
      "id": "96989869e835648c4b1bca9c5168ba48de2dd59abc8d8fadfeac3b10855086ec",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "0fad7cff8293e8c7ee1bfaf7bfc79a7c627fa76579dd251ebf388d3e1a56ff2e",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "781310915b2f5da1594c19d307130e3f4020b61baaf4991193b400b5d5e03280",
      "text": "The atomic unit a",
      "hash": "b18f52b56a62f3c99d9aa9c039a4d94c121ebebce9d126d14a398b8ee8e06730"
    },
    {
      "id": "dcd05df6c24ef60531e94d94cec7d204e7d838342e7593da9979235536bcd6c7",
      "text": "reads and writes. Roughly word-sized but not exactly — common words are one token, rare or long ones split into several.",
      "hash": "b0eeadc68bb93b174c233dd08d071d4cc028d66ccffc20932c97f7cc4571605d"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7c35bd10f664676f55f03064351021add44748a3b8d4b652cf457e0278e9549",
      "text": "Context window",
      "hash": "7696d0855331622dc12438057f5509348f9d6f0ec2eb3580e18a99d31eba86db"
    },
    {
      "id": "ffda2c44c06fa82e284433b53359da6b1712b8c55e2ee5a770fe2d432d3eb2ee",
      "text": "size, cost, and latency are all counted in tokens.",
      "hash": "221860974a4c19d9acd91e4f0d76d5024dd83bafcb903b19e071ee35b27ecc25"
    },
    {
      "id": "abce5705a66c3f25f88dd3aa4a1ceaf79e3ea7c8954187cf58381087294b127c",
      "text": "Text becomes tokens via a tokenizer: a fixed vocabulary of tens of thousands of fragments, learned before",
      "hash": "bbe4a24072cdd9efcae70a9ce2b5805be2c307106dd2532d38213f9f15732b02"
    },
    {
      "id": "6c6c11f41cd1fa287a4d7306c2b8cc82dd15d0c34807903b37b25b1051c29958",
      "text": ", that splits any input into a sequence of vocabulary entries. The model never sees characters or words — every piece of text is converted to tokens on the way in, and",
      "hash": "11919a12161814f78be8db182afd70a5d35c050369f3f3e9149cdf88a08f2515"
    },
    {
      "id": "2deaa9d832bc237ce34e9273acf282a12cfbbfe541268eea1a7477382503622f",
      "text": "next-token prediction",
      "hash": "8203f57feb66cc8742e92d9fe92000a0898a09207548cb184413f5f2607f0f54"
    },
    {
      "id": "2280ed1d7b6bcaa97d50cbceffc22b5cb486c91244375f33dbd5c914990e89f9",
      "text": "produces output one token at a time on the way out.",
      "hash": "bdffdbf542dcbf0eed8abc071fca9846d2d90ba59f52e11a50015f4216f558be"
    },
    {
      "id": "83df96ced233ccc71139018cf787d5972071d9256c6e96999729181f66cc9837",
      "text": "As a rule of thumb, a token is about three-quarters of an English word, so a thousand tokens is roughly 750 words. Code is less predictable: common keywords and idioms tokenize compactly, while generated identifiers, hashes, base64 blobs, and minified output split into many tokens per \"word\". The pattern: text that appeared often in the tokenizer's source material gets short, efficient encodings; text that didn't gets chopped into many small pieces. A hash like",
      "hash": "9128682bdbc4b07f804cd67603d96df4490896edf71e847f20ff34c03ba70a21"
    },
    {
      "id": "a5a7cc2ac7abf296a678ab044e169b05d28f57da9a02bd7d427483d71500ca96",
      "text": "never appeared anywhere, so it splits into many tokens, while",
      "hash": "9ca609c88b19f125fda7ec55643b1a5977b77f515b3f60eef9195273686ddb9a"
    },
    {
      "id": "3453bc7607bec71702963bd3d67bfbf232546bdfcc66f6832afe999188e568a7",
      "text": "is one. This is why a small-looking file full of unusual strings can occupy a surprising share of the context window.",
      "hash": "9374efb1250859e24eac193f03d68e6899d5a0cabd930edfa679accb8e1d2cba"
    },
    {
      "id": "cbfa0606fe9b73fb46f33b26c67eaac17acdb4a4f3dbd3fc72d305681fc727f1",
      "text": "Tokens are the unit everything else is measured in. Cost is per token — providers bill",
      "hash": "cf8c373506320d1dba323f0673eb4e681758e0fe8950459b68453da26292700e"
    },
    {
      "id": "81889d6b0ecddccf59133a4ac066b1cfbf6dbb09b62dfaf353397f46f4e1b951",
      "text": "input tokens",
      "hash": "f0c1cb4cda1985a408b12908c01227b01065a8cdfc2a03e2106ca60275f27d16"
    },
    {
      "id": "307ac692e4a60aacc079438204ad31eac1721667130deb0ad9ffa95b2a842fec",
      "text": "output tokens",
      "hash": "b6798bcee84a53a994de8822f2954fb739ce9a8eb119121f36b363fe86182357"
    },
    {
      "id": "ce647cbbd3d40fd3df1f4a53acddae9d0187ee4d6cf83da72bf168474a01c389",
      "text": "separately. Speed is tokens per second, since output is generated one token at a time. And the context window is a fixed number of tokens, so the token count of your files decides how much fits.",
      "hash": "df9827cb7902c1ac173910f9b51a053aa68caba53cae0891b385eff92adf631e"
    },
    {
      "id": "88cb35966491fba245f468f2177f0e1df65049fee3ab5896d4c6320569ec9f73",
      "text": "Avoid:",
      "hash": "0c98d3dd1920fdb71269240ba1ce3a7323099760ecd0b295f071aca6b07e30df"
    },
    {
      "id": "3d4d553ff8ccbc6e1c228b28819499bcc8ac8c99ed1666563a7e4dfca628e0fb",
      "text": "\"word\" — token boundaries don't match word boundaries, and tokens-per-second / tokens-per-dollar are the units that actually matter.",
      "hash": "b5de3509b448e397ef5c475c1bae12ab4520e5dca417d20bb694e4aa1ad91e22"
    },
    {
      "id": "c5b3f7a60e242cc4035b9919b25b5bf531ec55320c84f2985451ae2c5487e656",
      "text": "Usage:",
      "hash": "2bad3eeaf33caffe3bc9b482b4934ed19eb4ec3614c12373e1a5c5f8948217da"
    },
    {
      "id": "6a2f4d063ba92c72691293f2ec78f0c8e62544b17081df4548391691f46c2dd2",
      "text": "\"How big is this prompt going to be?\"",
      "hash": "38e9f4c22072038a0962262c27025403ac7ea4b2e7d16aede65cd2ddd72633fc"
    },
    {
      "id": "b2e32c42d4cffc6affa70940a585750b289173fa0314f60471be543e4f97d0ee",
      "text": "\"Run it through the tokenizer — the schema's compact but the JSON keys are weird, so they'll split into more tokens than you think.\"",
      "hash": "a03e4e54b10dc61bfa6e473b1f6e00aa89e1729f9c1838ba66ab6c9f3cc7653f"
    },
    {
      "id": "fde2b6c1f59d1932da73c3fe7fbf10bf59ed81db1ad779bbbbd236ba6e544957",
      "text": "Previous term",
      "hash": "735604aff9e8f2192b83df4905cfc8e395613e0ce05f8ca85a1d2d1d44fd59f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "a887f17b2a6feb1ac2b157f40e0a9885e6928f154c744b6c97cf3c31335df34e",
      "text": "Effort",
      "hash": "4387e5d3966fc436532792769763cd1ab7cccd6464d4c01c2b91261894e96b77"
    },
    {
      "id": "a445c1528750a9dde500835ad9e5027c8ce8d743749c3316c434f442ab2dd7dd",
      "text": "Next term",
      "hash": "5219c7ebdc0e098aa6db6f09e405c1b17ab75f1082862906a872e10a16818f9e"
    },
    {
      "id": "9fe0ea81c835e4511bed14d96802e16a7a93aba25db15dc3f843035dbbb69efd",
      "text": "Next-token prediction",
      "hash": "db2e13aa671f566f6c582c8ff074e0b702a81659695c239d0634c86b0e328583"
    },
    {
      "id": "a532e4c84f8543dbc1c1fed1f7f16c420e647b4b7788c692933676210e117417",
      "text": "Want more than vocabulary?",
      "hash": "5d5500a083006a1606e84a03c018904d01364631c6baea4c7a3f8f3f62bf94dc"
    },
    {
      "id": "b2174bf903405f8d343da3738e2ad481a994e7edc6b44b56f979136e89394c40",
      "text": "Join AI Hero for practical skills, thinking on AI engineering, and resources that keep you ahead of the curve.",
      "hash": "a082f7147e30da6afe92268d5668a530edfff13e64934f8f63f22c098db86133"
    },
    {
      "id": "f43fa2672a628584c6c48152acc8ddbcd27804f78a595c4ab1216d6329b331d0",
      "text": "First Name",
      "hash": "96ce6e6193a047260f5c32aa416d88b6e8959111f43f98457af9cc009a0907ad"
    },
    {
